---Decorative component used to draw a block of a single colour, or an outline around an area.
---@class ui.Rectangle : ui.Component
---@field fill boolean If true, this rectangle will be drawn as a single block, otherwise it will be drawn as an outline. Defaults to false.
---@field outlineThickness integer The pixel thickness of the outline drawn for this rectangle. Defaults to 1. Positive values will draw inwards, while negative values will draw outwards. Outlines are clipped by parent containers, which will affect negative outlines when a rectangle fills its container space.
